                <head>No. 3.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cadiz,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 7, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">American Minister:</hi></p>
                <p>The two despatches received and delivered. The captain has gone to Vigo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>EGGLESTON.</signed></closer>
